## Step 3: Attach Bedrock Permissions

Your Lambda needs permission to call Bedrock.

1. Go to Configuration → Permissions
2. Click the execution role name (opens IAM)
3. Click Add permissions → Attach policies
4. Attach: AmazonBedrockFullAccess

> For a beginner demo, this is the simplest option.
> You can restrict permissions later.

